{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dearest Marie,\n\nThe fair weather finally broke this morning, and the Kleins have departed for their journey. We met at breakfast at 9, where I paid six Kreuzer for a decent roll and coffee. Their daughter is pleasant enough, though her father speaks with that distinct, nasal Viennese affectation that I find exhausting. We did little sightseeing together; we simply sat.\n\nI walked alone to the Karlskirche this afternoon. The light was grey, but the architecture is imposing. I spent an hour there, thinking, as I often do, about how the stone must have been laid before the idea was fully formed. It is a strange tension, but the building holds.\n\nI am tired. The hotel bed is stiff, and I paid two Florins for the privilege. I hope the children are well and that Ludwig is not disturbing your peace. I shall stay three more days to see the Prater.\n\nYour loving\nGeorg"}}],"created":1795219353,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":197,"prompt_tokens":1095,"total_tokens":1292,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-WPC97lx2Orl55aM8cLm1MIZCw0F1CVZ2","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":1095,"prompt_ms":1036.108,"prompt_per_token_ms":0.9462173515981734,"prompt_per_second":1056.839634478259,"predicted_n":197,"predicted_ms":4632.063,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.63297448979592,"predicted_per_second":42.31375954947072}}